{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 9, :comments ["<b>And he shall take.</b> Just as the taking mentioned below is by the fistful, so too here it is by the fistful." "<b>A fire-offering, a pleasing fragrance.</b> It is stated for the animal burnt-offering — ריח ניחוח, and likewise for the bird burnt-offering and for the meal-offering — ריח ניחוח, to teach you: whether one brings much or one brings little, provided he directs his heart to heaven."], :book :leviticus, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 2, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:10:43.203611934Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}